    {
      "id": "claim_7b574b0743cd4710ae39bc4ff640c7fa",
      "statement": "score_jobs processes only pending jobs whose title is non-empty and not the HR主动沟通 placeholder and whose JD is non-empty; it runs quick_score first (rejecting to filtered without an LLM call) and then LLM deep scoring with bounded concurrency (default 3, clamped to 5), keeping the prefilter and all SQLite writes on the caller thread.",
